OL,3,GNEWSAPupils pen letters to help new
OL,4,Ahigh school starters
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of pupils across
OL,7,FLeicestershire will put on an oversized
OL,8,Fblazer and a tie as they start high
OL,9,Fschool this week.
OL,11,FIt is a daunting step for pupils and
OL,12,Fparents alike, but students at one
OL,13,Fschool in Leicester have attempted to
OL,14,Fmake life a little easier for their new
OL,15,Fclassmates.
OL,17,FPupils at Manor High School in Oadby
OL,18,Fhave penned letters to new Year 7
OL,19,Fstarters to offer a welcome, support
OL,20,Fand advice on how to navigate their
OL,21,Ffirst days.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
